{"sha":"50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344","node_id":"C_kwDOCqu4hNoAKDUwZTJhNTRmMGQwNGIxYWQyODg1Mzc0NjM3YjM4NDBiZTM3YTEzNDQ","commit":{"author":{"name":"Pavel Snajdr","email":"snajpa@snajpa.net","date":"2026-10-17T18:28:21Z"},"committer":{"name":"Pavel Snajdr","email":"snajpa@snajpa.net","date":"2026-10-18T06:36:19Z"},"message":"[vpsAdminOS] NFS: tolerate a cold NLM client during sysfs shutdown\n\nAn NFSv3 mount allocates an nlm_host before its first remote lock, but\nnlm_host.h_rpcclnt is still NULL until then. The server shutdown attribute\npasses that pointer to shutdown_client(), which otherwise dereferences it\nunconditionally. Cancellation can therefore crash the host even when the\nmount has never used NLM.\n\nThere are no RPC tasks to cancel when the client has not been allocated.\nLeave the server's terminal state handling unchanged and skip only the\nabsent RPC client.\n\nCarry the existing 6.12.109 OS compatibility repair in the downstream\nsource so upgrading the stable kernel retains the same NULL-safe behavior.\nThe version-scoped OS patch remains in place for the retained older pin.\n\nSigned-off-by: Pavel Snajdr <snajpa@snajpa.net>","tree":{"sha":"9325efe15abc6f8f1550164aa4c7879af30d4bda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpsfreecz/linux/git/trees/9325efe15abc6f8f1550164aa4c7879af30d4bda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpsfreecz/linux/git/commits/50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpsfreecz/linux/commits/50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344","html_url":"https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/commit/50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpsfreecz/linux/commits/50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344/comments","author":{"login":"snajpa","id":1138828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzg4Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1138828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa","html_url":"https://github.com/snajpa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"snajpa","id":1138828,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMzg4Mjg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1138828?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa","html_url":"https://github.com/snajpa","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/snajpa/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"54b820c18bbea3928fa6425dd0159c7611be2766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpsfreecz/linux/commits/54b820c18bbea3928fa6425dd0159c7611be2766","html_url":"https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/commit/54b820c18bbea3928fa6425dd0159c7611be2766"}],"stats":{"total":3,"additions":3,"deletions":0},"files":[{"sha":"d72e4c29444a40c53a6440192319ae20dd045dea","filename":"fs/nfs/sysfs.c","status":"modified","additions":3,"deletions":0,"changes":3,"blob_url":"https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/blob/50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344/fs%2Fnfs%2Fsysfs.c","raw_url":"https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/raw/50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344/fs%2Fnfs%2Fsysfs.c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vpsfreecz/linux/contents/fs%2Fnfs%2Fsysfs.c?ref=50e2a54f0d04b1ad2885374637b3840be37a1344","patch":"@@ -226,6 +226,9 @@ static bool shutdown_match_client(const struct rpc_task *task, const void *data)\n \n static void shutdown_client(struct rpc_clnt *clnt)\n {\n+\t/* There is nothing to cancel if the client is absent. */\n+\tif (!clnt)\n+\t\treturn;\n \tclnt->cl_shutdown = 1;\n \trpc_cancel_tasks(clnt, -EIO, shutdown_match_client, NULL);\n }"}]}